A translation to Zig of OffsetAllocator by Sebastian Aaltonen,
https://github.com/sebbbi/OffsetAllocator (commit 3610a73, 27 March 2023),
licensed, like the original, under the MIT License (LICENSE). Each
translated file names its source in its header. The translation keeps the
original's algorithm and every step that decides an offset, a node index or
a report, so that it gives the same results; it changes only the language,
the structure needed to express it in Zig, and the public interface.

    src/offset_allocator.zig  from offsetAllocator.hpp and offsetAllocator.cpp
    test/original_test.zig    from offsetAllocatorTests.cpp

